WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.640
Achoo!

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:06.110
My, oh my, are you catching 
a cold? Take care, now.

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:08.680
You're sounding pretty nasal 
yourself, Kazuma-san.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.080
I'll hurry and fix this tracksuit for you.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:15.020
You're the one who threw it 
in the fireplace, though.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:20.040
My, oh my, feeling hungry?

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:23.960
Actually, I guess I haven't 
eaten breakfast yet.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:28.420
You're the one who got carried away and 
spent all our money on booze, though.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:34.870
But... everyone was having 
so much fun partying!

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:41.680
That looks like the fancy bubbly 
I had hidden under my bed...

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:45.300
I wonder if the pawn shop's open...

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:45.630
Come here, Chomusuke.

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:48.950
Give it back! That's my last bottle!

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:50.330
It's my last hope!

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:52.050
I'm gonna go trade it for cash right now!

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:54.190
And if I can't, I'll just 
drink it all right here!

00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:56.450
Maybe that would warm me up a little!

00:00:56.630 --> 00:01:00.660
Don't! I can't fall asleep if 
I'm not holding that bottle!

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:03.710
You're making demands like that 
after burning my tracksuit?!

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:06.000
You ought to go sell that raiment, too!

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:07.470
What are you saying?!

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:10.500
This raiment is part of my 
identity as a goddess!

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.130
There's no way I can sell it!

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:14.260
Are you stupid? Why are you being so stupid?!

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:17.010
Steal!

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:21.020
Kazuma-sama!

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:23.970
I'm sorry for getting carried 
away, so please stop!

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:25.030
Shut up!

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:28.150
We haven't repaid any of our debt 
and Darkness still isn't back!

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:30.270
You should be more concerned about that!

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:33.110
Trouble, Kazuma! Major trouble!

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:39.030
Who are you?

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:54.630
<b>KONOSUBA!
God's Blessing on this Wonderful World! 2</b>

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:14.000
<b>Episode 4   A Betrothed for This Noble Daughter!</b>

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:14.290
Who are you?

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:17.290
Huh? She's... glad?

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:20.050
Kazuma! Can't you save this 
kind of play for later?!

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:18.530
Yes?

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:22.310
Wait... Is that you, Darkness?

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:24.050
We were so worried!

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:26.000
Darkness!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:28.060
Kazuma... Kazuma, he...

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.650
He stripped me against my will

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:32.770
and wants to sell my most intimate possession!

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:33.350
Wha?!

00:03:33.550 --> 00:03:34.730
Hey! Word choice!

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.800
Welcome back, Darkness.

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:39.200
Oh, Megumin. It's good to be back.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.460
That cat...

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:42.330
I won't ask what happened.

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:45.140
First, take a nice, long bath...

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:47.960
and let your body and soul recover...

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:50.810
Uh, what are you talking about?

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:53.860
I'm more curious about 
what Aqua was describing...

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:58.920
No doubt about it. 
This is an expensive dress.

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:02.360
You must've been through so much...

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:04.130
Where are you getting your weird ideas?!

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:07.400
Do you think the lord had his 
way with me or something?

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.910
We're just glad you're back.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:13.300
Go on, take that warm bath 
and cry your heart out.

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:17.750
You're wrong! He didn't have the 
guts to demand that much from me!

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:19.900
Look at this! This is the problem!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:20.820
What is it?

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:23.530
Wow, what a handsome guy!

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:24.440
Pisses me off.

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:26.050
What are you doing?!

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.080
My hands moved on their own...

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:33.830
So the hot guy is the lord's son, huh?

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:37.220
In exchange for the lenience 
you received, he demanded

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:39.290
an arranged marriage meeting with his son.

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:41.940
The reason I was away for so long

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:45.590
is because I was trying to 
figure out a way to prevent it.

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:48.690
My father doesn't hold Aldarp in high regard,

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:51.050
but he thinks highly of his son.

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:54.000
He's the one most excited about the idea.

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.370
Please! Come with me,

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:58.020
and help me convince my father!

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:00.560
Here you go.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.480
How about it? Good as new, right?

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:06.490
How is it that you're so versatile 
when it comes to stuff like this?

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:08.320
<i>It's true...</i>

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:12.250
<i>If we don't do something, our valuable 
crusader is going to be married off.</i>

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:13.590
<i>Our valued...</i>

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:16.170
Thank you, Aqua.

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.840
<i>She'll be... married?</i>

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:19.760
It's getting to the point where 
I'm having trouble refusing.

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:24.300
<i>Which means our crusader who can't 
land any hits will be leaving our party?</i>

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:23.970
Oh, it's fine! Something like this 
is a piece of cake for a goddess!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:27.850
No one would be able to 
tell it's not the original!

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:27.950
<i>It's not that I'm trying to subtly 
kick her out of the party...</i>

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:31.100
Literally godly skills! 
You can praise me some more—

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:30.880
Kazuma?

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:35.810
That's it!

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:39.560
I'm Kazuma.

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:43.840
What do you mean, I should 
accept the arranged marriage?!

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:46.820
Don't you care if Darkness can't 
adventure with us anymore?!

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:49.280
Look, refusing the arrangement

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:52.890
is just going to make that 
lord guy even less reasonable!

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:54.010
That's true...

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:56.830
In that case, you have to accept 
the arrangement, but then ruin it!

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:57.690
Ru—

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:00.370
And do it without hurting your family's name.

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:02.360
That's it! Let's do that!

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:04.900
If it works, I won't have to slap my father silly

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:07.340
every time he brings up 
the subject of marriage!

00:06:08.230 --> 00:06:10.070
<i>I feel bad for your old man...</i>

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.100
Satou Kazuma!

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.520
Is Satou Kazuma here?!

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:17.940
Wh-What is it this time?!

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:21.120
There are strange monsters 
surrounding the town.

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:22.690
Do you know anything about that?

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:23.790
Huh?

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.400
You will accompany us at once.

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:27.030
We have to refuse.

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:31.650
One of our most precious comrades 
is facing a grave crisis!

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:34.190
We cannot afford to ignore it!

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:36.290
Megumin...

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:37.790
Hey, calm down!

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:39.630
<i>Hang on...</i>

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:41.660
<i>Aqua I can manage,</i>

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:44.480
<i>but Megumin is weirdly smart 
about certain things.</i>

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:46.670
<i>Better to get her out of the way.</i>

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:47.760
Megumin...

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.260
Please, go.

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.510
If there's a large number of monsters,

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.470
that's a job for your explosion magic.

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:59.830
It's okay. You can leave 
Darkness to Aqua and me.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:00.710
But...

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:05.230
You're the only one who can do this.

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:08.150
I'm the only one?!

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:11.340
We're counting on you, 
ultimate arch wizard!

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:14.500
I will demonstrate my power!

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:19.080
KONOSUBA!

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:24.080
Y-You're certain, then, Lalatina?

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:26.490
I am, Father.

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:30.720
I, Lalatina, have decided to attend the 
meeting for this arranged marriage.

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:32.740
And these two are...?

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:35.050
My adventuring friends.

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:39.310
They will accompany me at the meeting 
as a temporary butler and maid.

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:45.690
How does it fit?

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:47.710
I think it's okay.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.810
Hey, that looks good on you.

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:57.620
You look like a proper servant!

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:01.790
I think the "wannabe-butler who's trying 
too hard" look suits you too, Kazuma.

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:04.820
Oh, that was <i>so</i> funny.

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:06.590
If we weren't in a noble's mansion,

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:09.080
I would've had to let you have it.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.860
Right, Miss Lalatina?

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:13.430
D-Don't call me "Miss Lalatina"!

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:17.440
<i>Her father ended up asking me for help.</i>

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:21.410
<i>He requested I ensure his daughter 
wouldn't cause an incident.</i>

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:28.310
<i>And if the meeting goes 
well, he'll reward me!</i>

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:31.440
<i>I can't help but feel motivated.</i>

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:34.560
You know what to do, right? 
I'm counting on you.

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:42.450
I'm glad you decided to attend the meeting.

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:45.190
I want you to find happiness, Lalatina.

00:08:45.780 --> 00:08:47.530
Please, Father.

00:08:47.530 --> 00:08:51.220
I simply said that I'd consider 
the arranged marriage.

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:52.090
What?

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:55.180
And after considering it,

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:58.720
I've decided that it's still too 
soon for me to get married.

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:00.470
It's too late now!

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:04.450
I agreed to meet with him, 
but I never said I would marry him!

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:05.980
I'll destroy it...

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.730
I'll destroy this stupid meeting!

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.440
L-Lalatina!

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:14.280
Please refrain from using such vulgar language.

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:17.260
You'll give your partner a bad impression.

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:18.490
You rat! Are you betraying me?!

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:21.850
I am currently serving as a temporary 
butler for the Dustiness family.

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:25.500
My wish is for your happiness, milady.

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:27.230
K-Kazuma-kun!

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:28.380
Damn you, Kazuma!

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:38.260
Sir Walther!

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:40.950
So you've come...

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:43.300
You're the one they intend for me to marry?

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:45.560
I am Dustiness Ford Lalatina!

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.090
You can call me Mistress Dus—

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:49.900
Milady! Please watch your step!

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:52.690
I thought you were going to help me!

00:09:52.870 --> 00:09:56.570
Did you forget the part about not 
besmirching your family's name?

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:59.340
If I have a bad reputation, 
fewer people will consider marrying me,

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:01.700
and I can continue to focus on adventuring!

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:04.220
I'm even prepared to be disinherited!

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:05.980
Even then, I will survive as best I can

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:08.530
and continue accepting 
quests I'm unqualified for,

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:11.300
until I am overwhelmed and captured 
by the Devil King's army,

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:12.840
held down by them...

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:14.800
That doesn't sound like the 
Devil King. Sounds like a perv.

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:15.380
That's the kind of life I want!

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:18.490
You finally came out and admitted it...

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:22.300
Besides, he's far from my type of man.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.990
First, he seems to be of 
absolutely decent character.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:26.560
He never angers toward anyone.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:27.730
He works hard

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:30.650
and was strong enough to achieve
knighthood at the earliest age on record.

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:32.800
That sounds pretty good to me.

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:33.480
How?!

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.220
If you're a noble, you should act like one,

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:37.430
with a vulgar grin on your face at all times!

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:41.400
What exactly is that pure, 
focused gaze of his?!

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:42.620
I want something more...

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:44.730
Like what Kazuma always does,

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:47.210
when he looks at me as if he's 
licking me all over with his gaze!

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.290
I-I-I do not look at you that way!

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:51.470
He never angers?!

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:52.320
What a moron!

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:55.250
Using a maid's mistakes to subject 
her to all kinds of punishment

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:57.090
is what nobles are supposed to do!

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:59.730
Besides, the type I like is

00:10:59.730 --> 00:11:01.970
the polar opposite of such a competent man!

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:06.250
He's not particularly attractive and
can be either scrawny or fat.

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:09.490
He needs to be weak-willed enough 
that, despite my love for him,

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:11.980
he's easily strung along by
another woman's affection.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:15.350
Someone who's in rut all year round— 
the more perverse, the better!

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:19.560
A failure at life, who tries to 
take the easiest route possible!

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:21.410
And if he's in debt, that'd be even better!

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.740
Then he could drink all day and never work,

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:26.380
and complain that it's 
society's fault he's a loser!

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:28.910
He'd throw an empty bottle 
at me while saying...

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:30.950
"Hey, Darkness.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:34.080
Why don't you use that nasty body 
of yours to earn us some cash?"

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:40.150
<i>Damn it all! This girl is completely hopeless!</i>

00:11:42.150 --> 00:11:44.010
Well, let me introduce myself.

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:47.010
I am Alexei Barnes Walther.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:50.350
I am Dustiness Ford Lalatina.

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:53.700
I'll spare you the specific 
details of my family.

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:55.950
Telling them to an upstart noble's son

00:11:55.950 --> 00:11:57.790
wouldn't do any—

00:11:57.790 --> 00:11:58.920
Is something wrong?

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:03.270
N-Nothing. It's just, seeing 
your face made me feel si—

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:04.700
Eee!

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:11.310
It seems meeting you has made milady 
a bit over-excited, Walther-sama.

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:14.830
Actually, she does seem quite flushed...

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.540
I must say, I'm embarrassed.

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:18.720
Hey, milady.

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:22.160
Mouth off any more and you're 
gonna get it even colder, got it?

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:24.070
I-I consider it a reward.

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:27.180
<i>The daughter of this household 
never breaks character.</i>

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.310
I suppose I might be in the way here.

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:35.020
Why don't you two go for a walk in the garden?

00:12:45.670 --> 00:12:48.160
<i>What was that?! Awesome! 
I should have her teach me later!</i>

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:49.410
Do you have any hobbies?

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:51.410
I enjoy a bit of goblin hunting—

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:55.830
You certainly seem to get along well.

00:12:56.070 --> 00:12:57.710
<i>Did I overdo it?</i>

00:12:58.070 --> 00:12:58.550
Hee-hee.

00:12:58.550 --> 00:12:59.230
<i>Hee-hee?</i>

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:03.640
Yes, this butler accompanies me at all times.

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:05.650
We take our meals and baths together...

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:08.970
A-And of course, in bed at night...

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:14.640
<i>Where exactly is this 
pervert's shame threshold?</i>

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:18.770
Enough! I can't put up 
with this any longer!

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:22.820
Now, Walther, was it?

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:25.450
You'll accompany me to 
the training hall, now!

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:28.370
I'll test your mettle there!

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:30.990
Hey! Darkness...

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:32.150
See?!

00:13:32.150 --> 00:13:33.160
If you're a noble,

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:36.610
you should learn to maintain a 
lascivious gaze, like Kazuma here!

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:40.030
Miss Lalatina, I am a knight.

00:13:40.510 --> 00:13:42.630
I could never raise my sword to a woman.

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:44.860
You spineless wretch...

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:48.380
Well, Kazuma over here claims to  
be an advocate of gender equality,

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:52.080
and then boasts about his 
willingness to dropkick women!

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:58.690
To be honest, I came here to 
turn down the arranged marriage.

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:02.100
But after seeing you, 
I've changed my mind.

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:05.650
You speak frankly, but you 
still have a charming side.

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:08.790
It's refreshing how you don't mince words,

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:11.890
and the way you treat your 
servant as an equal...

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.000
I've taken an interest in you.

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:19.670
Isn't this enough?! Why won't you give up?!

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:23.690
What's wrong?!

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:28.140
Don't hold back! Keep it coming!

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:30.050
Show me the strength of your resolve!

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:34.920
<i>This entire time, Darkness's 
sword hasn't hit anything,</i>

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:37.730
<i>with Walther having the clear 
advantage... and yet...</i>

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:41.270
I concede.

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:45.500
I may have greater skill, but your 
strength of will was greater.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:49.030
I cannot strike you any more.

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:52.780
You are a truly strong person.

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:54.590
<i>It feels like he's given in</i>

00:14:54.590 --> 00:14:57.080
<i>after Darkness demonstrated 
how firm her resolve is...</i>

00:14:57.420 --> 00:15:01.040
<i>But knowing how her head works, 
I just can't be impressed.</i>

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:02.700
You spineless fool!

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:03.870
Fine, come on, Kazuma!

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:07.050
Demonstrate your ruthlessness 
and depth of depravity to Walther!

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:09.930
<i>What the heck is she saying?</i>

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:11.650
I'd actually like to see

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:15.680
the kind of fighting a man who's earned 
Miss Lalatina's trust would display.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:18.430
<i>And here's Walther, making things worse.</i>

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:21.400
Well, the arranged marriage is off anyway...

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:26.080
Besides, I doubt you'd spread any 
bad rumors about milady here.

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:27.650
Yes! That's it, Kazuma!

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:30.440
I've actually been waiting 
to face off against you!

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:32.960
Now, give me everything you have—

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:33.360
Create Water!

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:38.510
Is something wrong?

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:41.850
I didn't expect you to use 
magic in a duel of swords...

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:43.380
Is that how it works?

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:47.940
What a creep.

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:51.070
It's clear Kazuma-san is unrivaled 
at the art of sexual harassment.

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.680
Such a creep.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:53.670
I wasn't trying to—

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:54.740
See, Walther?!

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:57.340
You need to pay close attention 
to how he does this sort of thing!

00:15:57.340 --> 00:15:58.640
Oh, damn it!

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:02.140
You want everything I have?! 
Then here it comes!

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:04.010
Freeze!

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:06.800
H-He's a demon!

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:08.870
Not only does he douse her 
with water in winter,

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:10.320
but then he uses ice magic?!

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:15.460
Well, he earned names like "Crapuma" 
and "Kazutrash" for a reason.

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:19.540
This total lack of mercy!

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:24.210
Th-This... is so good!

00:16:24.520 --> 00:16:26.590
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:28.190
That's it, Darkness!

00:16:28.190 --> 00:16:31.240
Puny Kazuma has no chance 
against you in a grappling match!

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:34.930
<i>I am so gonna sell off 
that raiment of hers later!</i>

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:38.810
You think you can overpower 
me?! How insulting!

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:42.890
The difference in strength between a crusader 
like me and an adventurer like you is—

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:47.750
You should know I wouldn't fight fair!

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:49.440
We've known each other long 
enough! Figure it out!

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.320
Ow!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:56.740
D-Drain Touch, eh?

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:59.630
But before you can drain my stamina,

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:02.000
I'll break your arms!

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:06.000
G-Go ahead and try— Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:09.770
<i>This is bad... I keep draining, but 
this workhorse isn't slowing down!</i>

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:13.930
H-Hey... How about a little wager?

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:18.010
The loser has to do any 
one thing the winner says.

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:22.020
Very well! When I win, 
I'll have you kneel before me!

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.270
<i>Here's my chance!</i>

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:25.900
All right, then, it's a promise.

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:28.790
And when I win, you can cry and 
beg, but I'm not gonna stop!

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:30.520
Wh-What are you going to do?

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:34.010
Something that'll have you crying 
and begging for forgiveness!

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:38.440
I can already picture you desperately 
begging me for mercy...

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:41.660
I'll make you say, "Please stop! 
Please forgive me!"

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:44.860
Oh, don't get ahead of me, you greedy girl!

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:48.630
Because what I have in mind is way 
crazier than whatever you're thinking!

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:52.260
Wha— S-Stop it!

00:17:52.260 --> 00:17:57.050
I-I want to resist, but the Drain 
Touch is sapping my strength...

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:59.090
<i>I'm pretty sure she's 
just loosening her grip.</i>

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:04.850
At this rate, I will lose...

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:03.970
Amazing...

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:08.340
I'm gonna drain your stamina 
until you pass out!

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:11.380
I've got something crazy 
for you when you wake up!

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:13.860
Look forward to it!

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:19.130
No matter how you humiliate 
me, my heart will nev—

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:20.620
Crazy?

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:22.500
Something crazy...

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:25.580
S-Something... crazy...

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:28.120
Something crazy?!

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:34.760
Go on, take that warm bath 
and cry your heart out.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.740
K-K-K-Kazuma!

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:40.590
Wh-What were you planning to do 
with my leftover bathwater?!

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:43.430
Sh... Sho...

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:47.670
Shomefing cwazy!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:52.520
I-I win!

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:55.100
I see why they call you "Kazutrash"!

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:56.360
How rude!

00:18:56.930 --> 00:19:00.140
I just came by with something to... drink...

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:16.140
They did it.

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:17.130
Okay, execute them.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:19.050
No! You've got it all wrong!

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.050
KONOSUBA.

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:25.060
My daughter has always been a 
bit awkward around people...

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:27.850
Even after becoming a crusader, 
she was still alone.

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:30.740
Every day, she'd drop by Eris-sama's church,

00:19:30.740 --> 00:19:34.040
praying for friends to adventure with...

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:36.020
And then, one day, she finally had one.

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:40.070
She was so happy when she returned and 
told me about the thief girl she had met.

00:19:40.390 --> 00:19:44.910
Her mother died when she was young, 
so I may have spoiled her a bit...

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:47.170
But I also tried to let her have her freedom.

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:50.460
Maybe that wasn't for the best...

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:52.580
<i>Nah, I think that's her, not you.</i>

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:56.430
Miss Lalatina is a wonderful woman.

00:19:56.430 --> 00:20:00.340
If it weren't for Kazuma-kun, 
I'd sincerely want to marry her myself.

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:03.860
Sorry, but I'm not sure 
what you're trying to say.

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:07.170
I think you can make Miss Lalatina 
happier than I could.

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:08.630
Hey, you wanna step outside?

00:20:08.630 --> 00:20:10.690
I don't care if you're a lord's son!

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:15.130
Kazuma-san, cut it out! 
You're gonna get me executed, too!

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:21.410
Kazuma-kun, please continue 
to look after my daughter.

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:26.060
Make sure she doesn't 
do anything too foolish.

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:28.330
Please.

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:31.700
Uh... Well... Sure.

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:37.920
Oh, you're awake.

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:42.470
These clothes... Is it already over?

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:45.840
Did you do something foul to me 
while I was unconscious?!

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:48.350
I did not! I haven't done anything yet!

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:52.270
While you were asleep, 
things got kinda serious!

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:55.400
Hee-hee.

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:55.980
Hee-hee?

00:20:57.450 --> 00:20:59.650
Father, Walther-sama...

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:02.990
Please, forget about this 
arranged marriage meeting.

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:05.790
I've been keeping it a secret, but...

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:08.260
Kazuma's child is growing inside me...

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:12.090
Hey! How the hell can you say 
that about a virgin like me?!

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:16.270
I see. You're having 
Kazuma-kun's child, then?

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:19.630
I'll tell my father that I decided 
to refuse the arrangement.

00:21:19.850 --> 00:21:21.970
That'll probably be more convenient.

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:23.920
Uh... Yeah...

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:29.380
<i>He's a really nice guy...</i>

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:32.100
<i>C'mon, man, take Darkness off my hands!</i>

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:32.680
Hee-hee.

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:36.690
A grandchild... My first grandchild...

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:41.690
F-F-F-Finally, I'll have a 
darling grandchild...

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:47.070
I didn't realize the two 
of you were like that...

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:50.920
G-Gotta tell someone... 
Gotta tell the guys in town!

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:52.730
That Kazutrash and Darkness are—

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:53.950
Why did you believe her, too?!

00:21:56.290 --> 00:22:00.160
Satou Kazuma! Is Satou Kazuma here?!

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:41.260
<b>Episode 5</b>

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:41.260
<b>Servitude for This Masked Knight!</b>

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:41.300
<b>Beloved Father. I no longer wish to strike a member of my family whom I care for. 
Are you aware that "tough love" is often harder on the one giving it than 
on the recipient? Especially on their hearts. So for now, please, allow me to
live life as a knight for the time being. From your disobedient daughter, Lalatina.</b>

00:23:32.220 --> 00:23:34.140
Beloved Father.

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:37.980
I no longer wish to strike a member 
of my family whom I care for.

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:41.170
Are you aware that "tough love" 
is often harder on the one giving—
